WEBVTT

00:00.930 --> 00:02.920
<i>(Isn't that maybe how love's defined?)</i>

00:02.920 --> 00:04.650
<i>Wow! A gift for you!</i>

00:04.650 --> 00:06.520
<i>(So, isn't that true love defined?)</i>

00:11.930 --> 00:13.710
<i>Nothing happening,</i>

00:13.710 --> 00:15.910
<i>every day feels the same</i>

00:15.910 --> 00:17.320
<i>Over and over, just</i>

00:17.320 --> 00:19.400
<i>waiting for time to pass</i>

00:19.400 --> 00:21.420
<i>When I'm with you,</i>

00:21.420 --> 00:22.620
<i>I can feel</i>

00:22.620 --> 00:24.750
<i>something so special,</i>

00:24.750 --> 00:27.880
<i>and I want to make it real</i>

00:27.880 --> 00:30.380
<i>Look, I'm really grateful every day, but you know</i>

00:30.380 --> 00:32.270
<i>I feel like I'm not doing enough in return</i>

00:32.270 --> 00:33.920
<i>"I was just feeling like it.</i>

00:33.920 --> 00:35.720
<i>No real meaning or reason why."</i>

00:35.720 --> 00:40.110
<i>Stop complaining and just take it already!</i>

00:39.080 --> 00:40.960
<i>(Isn't that maybe how love's defined?)</i>

00:40.960 --> 00:43.520
<i>Yeah, there's no way that's how it goes!</i>

00:42.680 --> 00:44.320
<i>(So, isn't that true love defined?)</i>

00:44.320 --> 00:46.360
<i>Whoa oh oh oh oh</i>

00:46.360 --> 00:48.810
<i>An angel just landed</i>

00:48.810 --> 00:50.700
<i>Right in front of me</i>

00:50.700 --> 00:52.320
<i>With a smile that looked</i>

00:52.320 --> 00:53.990
<i>Like her wings spreading open</i>

00:53.990 --> 00:55.950
<i>Hey, that's against all the rules</i>

00:55.950 --> 00:57.360
<i>You look so happy</i>

00:57.360 --> 00:59.290
<i>Wipe off that look</i>

00:59.290 --> 01:01.180
<i>Before my mind goes blank</i>

01:01.180 --> 01:03.020
<i>If you keep this up,</i>

01:03.020 --> 01:05.640
<i>You're gonna spoil me rotten</i>

01:06.460 --> 01:09.760
<i>Come on, you gotta do something about this</i>

01:08.220 --> 01:10.480
<i>So, let's get started</i>

01:10.480 --> 01:11.610
<i>I want to know</i>

01:11.610 --> 01:13.640
<i>A lot more about</i>

01:13.640 --> 01:15.680
<i>The world you live in</i>

01:15.680 --> 01:17.880
<i>So, let's get started</i>

01:17.880 --> 01:18.910
<i>I want to laugh</i>

01:18.910 --> 01:20.890
<i>A lot more with you</i>

01:20.890 --> 01:23.050
<i>In the world you live in</i>

01:22.350 --> 01:26.640
The Angel Next Door
Spoils Me Rotten

01:23.050 --> 01:25.020
<i>I want to know more</i>

01:25.020 --> 01:27.690
<i>I want to laugh more</i>

01:29.980 --> 01:31.940
Good morning!

01:30.720 --> 01:31.940
Good morning.

01:31.940 --> 01:33.070
What's that?

01:33.070 --> 01:34.030
A change of clothes.

01:34.030 --> 01:34.860
Wherefore?

01:35.230 --> 01:36.040
Put me up?

01:36.040 --> 01:37.100
Huh?

01:38.520 --> 01:40.280
Got in a fight with Dad this morning.

01:40.280 --> 01:42.080
About Chitose?

01:42.080 --> 01:43.020
Yeah.

01:43.020 --> 01:44.870
So? How long do you need to stay?

01:45.340 --> 01:46.410
Hmm.

01:46.960 --> 01:48.870
At least three days, if I can.

01:49.320 --> 01:53.140
Well spring break starts tomorrow, 
so it's no problem if you stay over.

01:53.670 --> 01:56.760
But I should let her know first.

01:56.760 --> 02:01.760
A Promise with the Angel

02:02.120 --> 02:04.270
It's good to see you again, Akazawa-san.

02:04.270 --> 02:06.520
Good to see you, too!

02:06.520 --> 02:08.350
I hate to barge in on your love nest lik—

02:08.350 --> 02:10.810
O-Ouch! It was a <i>joke</i>!

02:11.460 --> 02:13.400
I'm sorry to trouble you like this.

02:13.400 --> 02:17.870
Oh, it's fine. The more the merrier.

02:17.870 --> 02:20.320
He'll only make it noisier.

02:20.320 --> 02:23.240
That isn't something we say to guests.

02:25.210 --> 02:28.620
Well, then. I'll start dinner, 
so make yourself at home.

02:34.580 --> 02:36.920
You're close enough that you gave her a key?

02:36.920 --> 02:37.850
Shove it.

02:39.010 --> 02:41.160
Amazing!

02:41.160 --> 02:42.600
Thank you very much.

02:43.100 --> 02:47.920
Amane is way too lucky 
to eat this cooking every day.

02:47.920 --> 02:49.800
Yeah, I'm aware of that.

02:50.390 --> 02:51.750
Today was delicious, too.

02:52.230 --> 02:53.930
Thank you very much.

02:55.270 --> 02:57.050
I really think...

02:57.050 --> 02:57.900
What?

02:58.600 --> 03:00.820
Nah, I'll save it.

03:03.640 --> 03:08.700
Man, you're so nice to Shiina-san. 
There's no way you aren't into her.

03:08.990 --> 03:10.280
Shut up.

03:10.280 --> 03:13.670
Yeah, yeah. I know you won't just admit it.

03:14.190 --> 03:15.500
But, look.

03:15.500 --> 03:20.780
Everyone at school probably thinks you're
 just some weird, antisocial nerd.

03:21.210 --> 03:22.930
I'm aware of that.

03:23.520 --> 03:28.200
But that's all based on surface stuff, 
not on who you really are inside.

03:28.890 --> 03:33.200
Shiina-san does see the inside, though,
 and you two still get along.

03:33.200 --> 03:35.750
Makes me happy to see it.

03:37.590 --> 03:40.490
Shiina-san really trusts you.

03:41.290 --> 03:44.280
Before you brush it off and say 
it'll never happen between you two,

03:44.620 --> 03:46.220
take a closer look, bud.

03:47.860 --> 03:49.140
Oh, yeah?

03:52.760 --> 03:56.670
<i>Ikkun only? Not fair! 
I want to eat Mahirun's cooking, too!</i>

03:56.670 --> 03:59.670
Well, that isn't up to me. Talk to Shiina.

03:59.670 --> 04:02.440
<i>Fine! I'll go ask Mahiru!</i>

04:03.180 --> 04:05.340
And now look who's here!

04:05.340 --> 04:07.260
You didn't waste a second!

04:07.680 --> 04:12.030
When I thought of staying over 
at Mahirun's, I couldn't sit still!

04:12.030 --> 04:13.100
Staying over?

04:13.100 --> 04:16.330
Since it's spring break, 
I figured it would be fine.

04:16.860 --> 04:19.080
Mahirun's okay with it, too, right?

04:20.410 --> 04:21.990
<i>She forced her way in.</i>

04:23.450 --> 04:25.880
I can't wait to eat Mahirun's cooking!

04:25.880 --> 04:28.670
Ikkun! I missed you!

04:27.590 --> 04:30.880
You don't need to worry. 
I already agreed to it.

04:28.670 --> 04:30.880
I missed you, too, Chi!

04:30.880 --> 04:31.710
Really?

04:31.710 --> 04:34.000
I was super lonely!

04:34.000 --> 04:35.900
Can I help with something?

04:34.750 --> 04:37.580
I can't wait to try Mahirun's home cooking!

04:37.580 --> 04:40.560
Is it the cooking, or did you
 really come just to see me?

04:39.440 --> 04:42.120
Too steamy for you over there?

04:40.560 --> 04:44.090
Huh? Of course not...

04:42.120 --> 04:44.090
Yeah, they get so touchy-feely.

04:45.480 --> 04:47.340
By the way, what's for lunch today?

04:47.690 --> 04:50.680
Chitose-san requested omurice.

04:50.680 --> 04:53.820
You like egg dishes, too, 
don't you, Amane-kun?

04:53.820 --> 04:55.620
Yeah, eggs are great!

04:56.540 --> 05:00.020
And yours are always the best, 
so I'm excited for it.

05:03.580 --> 05:04.800
What's wrong?

05:04.800 --> 05:09.020
It's very nice of you to say, 
but don't surprise me like that.

05:09.020 --> 05:10.470
What do you mean?

05:11.440 --> 05:13.410
You don't need to know!

05:17.760 --> 05:21.320
All that and they aren't together? 
I really don't get it.

05:21.320 --> 05:22.900
Me neither.

05:29.180 --> 05:31.820
Wow, that was so good!

05:31.820 --> 05:34.600
You really can cook anything, Shiina-san!

05:35.050 --> 05:41.230
It's amazing you can make an omelette 
that's still soft-scrambled and fluffy inside!

05:41.770 --> 05:44.920
It's all thanks to the person 
who taught me to cook.

05:44.920 --> 05:49.570
If I got that person to teach me, 
maybe I could get as good as Mahirun.

05:50.000 --> 05:54.680
If you stopped fooling around and 
experimenting, I'm sure you'd do fine.

05:55.260 --> 05:59.380
But it isn't just cooking. You could try 
to chill out a little in general.

06:00.030 --> 06:01.940
You've got a good model here to learn from.

06:02.430 --> 06:05.740
I could never be like Mahirun.

06:05.740 --> 06:07.170
She seems so uptight.

06:08.050 --> 06:10.340
Hey, that's rude to Shiina.

06:10.700 --> 06:16.600
I know. But Mahirun at school... 
always looks so bored.

06:18.350 --> 06:20.170
Do I really seem that way?

06:20.170 --> 06:24.400
Well, I can't say for sure 
since we're in different classes.

06:24.400 --> 06:30.100
Maybe not bored, but just kind of aloof. 
I mean, distant from everyone else.

06:34.320 --> 06:37.600
But when I see that cute 
and innocent look on your face,

06:37.600 --> 06:39.800
I know this is the real you.

06:40.580 --> 06:43.250
I like this Mahirun the best!

06:45.030 --> 06:49.000
Mahirun, hey, why don't you 
open up a little?

06:49.000 --> 06:51.890
I bet you could, like, 
totally get Amane to spoil you.

06:53.400 --> 06:57.360
I mean, he's always super sweet 
to people who are nice to him,

06:57.360 --> 06:59.960
so I bet you could tame him 
in no time, Mahiru.

07:00.940 --> 07:02.490
I wouldn't do that!

07:03.520 --> 07:06.400
What you're imagining 
will never happen, Chitose-san.

07:07.040 --> 07:08.280
Oh, yeah?

07:20.840 --> 07:22.090
The bath is all yours.

07:22.090 --> 07:23.040
Cool.

07:28.590 --> 07:31.590
<b>Chitose Shirakawa</b>

07:28.590 --> 07:31.590
<b>Just now</b>

07:28.590 --> 07:31.590
<b>Look, look! Mahirun's so cute!</b>

07:28.590 --> 07:31.590
<b>*I got permission.</b>

07:28.590 --> 07:31.590
<b>Chitose Shirakawa</b>

07:28.590 --> 07:31.590
<b>Just now</b>

07:28.590 --> 07:31.590
<b>Sent a picture</b>

07:29.810 --> 07:31.210
From Chitose?

07:38.470 --> 07:40.310
<i>That idiot!</i>

07:43.470 --> 07:47.770
Chi said, "Take one of Amane, too."

07:47.770 --> 07:50.320
And guys don't care if you take 
pictures of them, right?

07:50.650 --> 07:54.450
I guess not, but there's 
no reason to take one of me.

07:54.450 --> 07:55.910
Oh, there totally is.

07:57.740 --> 08:00.830
<i>The next day, Itsuki's three-day visit ended.</i>

08:01.260 --> 08:03.990
<i>After that, he's spending 
a couple days at Chitose's.</i>

08:04.750 --> 08:06.590
W-With Mr. Bear?

08:06.920 --> 08:09.500
Yeah. She sent me a picture like that.

08:10.740 --> 08:12.420
You really are taking care of it.

08:12.420 --> 08:16.720
Well, of course I am. 
It's something you chose for me.

08:16.720 --> 08:19.520
Don't worry, I'll treasure it.

08:19.960 --> 08:23.890
I clean and pet it every day, 
and I cuddle up to him in be—

08:24.270 --> 08:25.060
Uh...

08:25.600 --> 08:27.080
I didn't just say that!

08:27.080 --> 08:29.570
Pretend I didn't! Please forget it!

08:29.570 --> 08:31.650
Er, um, it's too late for that.

08:31.650 --> 08:33.680
It makes me look bad!

08:33.680 --> 08:37.490
I sound like a child, 
sleeping with a stuffed animal.

08:38.060 --> 08:41.800
I can imagine it and it's super cute! 
Okay by me!

08:41.800 --> 08:43.540
Please stop imagining it!

08:44.110 --> 08:46.940
You need to share something embarrassing, too!

08:46.940 --> 08:48.710
It isn't fair if it's just me!

08:48.710 --> 08:49.590
Huh?!

08:49.960 --> 08:54.170
If you won't tell me, I'll send 
Akazawa-san a message and ask him.

08:54.670 --> 08:56.890
When did you exchange numbers?!

08:57.360 --> 09:00.830
I asked Chitose-san to tell me 
and we've been in touch.

09:00.830 --> 09:02.520
Even that picture yesterday...

09:03.560 --> 09:05.940
Oh, never mind!

09:06.290 --> 09:07.660
Please forget it.

09:09.810 --> 09:12.840
Hey, you got a text or something.

09:12.840 --> 09:13.900
Okay.

09:17.800 --> 09:18.820
Mahiru?

09:21.350 --> 09:23.850
It's... nothing at all.

09:24.380 --> 09:26.010
Please don't worry about it.

09:26.960 --> 09:31.920
The Angel Next Door
Spoils Me Rotten

09:40.640 --> 09:43.810
You are really nothing but trouble.

09:44.240 --> 09:46.240
You sure take after him.

09:46.240 --> 09:48.810
I can't imagine anything more annoying.

09:48.810 --> 09:52.750
You could have at least turned out like me,

09:52.750 --> 09:55.070
but you ended up like him.

09:55.530 --> 10:00.670
I don't care, though. Once you graduate 
college, we'll go our separate ways.

10:00.670 --> 10:02.330
No point in losing sleep over it.

10:02.730 --> 10:05.540
Keep sending me the necessary paperwork.

10:05.540 --> 10:06.700
Mail is fine.

10:06.700 --> 10:07.830
Okay.

10:08.710 --> 10:13.000
Bye, then. Mind your own business 
and please don't cause trouble again.

10:36.000 --> 10:37.900
Were you listening?

10:37.900 --> 10:41.410
Shiina

10:38.360 --> 10:41.410
I'm sorry. Um, who was that?

10:41.840 --> 10:45.160
Sayo Shiina. My biological mother.

10:45.680 --> 10:50.170
Just so you know, she's always 
been like that, so I'm used to it.

10:50.670 --> 10:53.960
My mother has always hated me.

10:54.560 --> 10:57.380
She's never going to change, 
so please don't be concerned.

11:11.560 --> 11:12.900
Stay with me.

11:15.490 --> 11:19.900
I'll be fine. You don't 
need to worry, Amane-kun.

11:20.620 --> 11:22.940
I'm saying that I want you to stay with me.

11:50.520 --> 11:54.620
It's a boring story, but may I tell you?

11:54.620 --> 11:55.340
Mm-hmm.

11:57.120 --> 12:01.770
My parents didn't marry out of love.

12:01.770 --> 12:07.990
I'll spare you the details, but it was 
more about their families' mutual interests.

12:08.380 --> 12:13.060
So it seems they never 
intended to have children.

12:15.030 --> 12:17.940
But one night, they made a mistake.

12:19.130 --> 12:24.250
Once I was born, they reluctantly 
supported me, but only financially.

12:26.260 --> 12:30.020
I don't think they ever intended to raise me.

12:30.020 --> 12:32.860
What do you mean, they never 
meant to raise you?

12:34.580 --> 12:37.620
They only rarely came home.

12:38.520 --> 12:42.870
And when they did, 
they only treated it like a hotel.

12:44.050 --> 12:48.120
Ever since I was young, 
I've haven't seen much of my parents.

12:50.550 --> 12:53.710
I don't remember them 
ever acting like parents.

12:53.710 --> 12:57.960
The person who actually raised me 
was our housekeeper.

12:58.530 --> 13:01.960
My parents just handed me 
money and left me alone.

13:02.860 --> 13:04.870
It was clear I wasn't wanted.

13:06.800 --> 13:09.810
But no matter how hard 
I tried, or how good I was,

13:10.320 --> 13:12.310
they never paid attention to me.

13:12.980 --> 13:15.810
I guess they never will really look at me.

13:16.880 --> 13:22.580
I grew up properly, excelled at studying, 
sports, and even housework,

13:24.350 --> 13:28.310
but they never once paid any attention to me.

13:30.760 --> 13:36.230
I keep trying, even though I know 
it'll never change. I must be stupid.

13:38.450 --> 13:40.220
All of my efforts were for nothing.

13:43.670 --> 13:46.810
They can't get divorced while I'm around.

13:47.800 --> 13:50.040
Neither one wants to take me in.

13:51.000 --> 13:54.980
They're just waiting until I finish college.

13:55.420 --> 14:00.400
Once I become independent, 
we'll basically be strangers.

14:00.400 --> 14:01.860
That's so...

14:02.900 --> 14:06.750
When my mother told me directly 
that I was an "unwanted child,"

14:06.750 --> 14:08.860
it was a pretty big shock.

14:09.670 --> 14:14.740
It left me feeling so numb I ended up 
just sitting on a swing in the rain.

14:18.560 --> 14:21.610
I thought, if I'm such a burden, 
why did you even have me?

14:23.770 --> 14:25.260
A-Amane-kun...

14:25.260 --> 14:31.600
I think I understand now
why you turned out like this.

14:32.120 --> 14:34.630
You mean someone so cold?

14:34.630 --> 14:36.090
Hell no.

14:36.590 --> 14:40.730
I mean someone so restrained, who doesn't
 want others to see her imperfections.

14:42.400 --> 14:47.110
I mean, I know isn't my place 
to criticize your family.

14:47.610 --> 14:50.390
I can't stick my nose 
into another family's business.

14:51.670 --> 14:54.160
But I can pretend not to see
 what you don't want seen.

14:54.160 --> 14:56.010
If you want to cry, then cry.

14:56.080 --> 15:00.300
If you keep trying so hard to hold it back, 
you're just gonna suffocate.

15:04.320 --> 15:06.460
Will you keep it a secret?

15:07.000 --> 15:08.680
I don't see anything to tell.

15:08.680 --> 15:12.580
Then, just for a bit, 
lend me your shoulder...

15:24.530 --> 15:26.150
Y-You're looking now!

15:26.800 --> 15:29.610
Of course I am. You were leaning on me.

15:30.380 --> 15:33.260
I made sure I couldn't see
 the actual crying, though.

15:35.990 --> 15:36.990
Amane-kun?

15:37.360 --> 15:38.810
What now?

15:38.810 --> 15:40.460
Thank you.

15:41.160 --> 15:42.870
I don't know what you mean.

15:43.590 --> 15:46.580
Please let me lean on you a little longer.

15:57.490 --> 16:00.010
What am I supposed to do now?

16:03.000 --> 16:05.500
No matter how hard I try, they ignore me.

16:05.930 --> 16:07.520
Other people are the same way.

16:08.180 --> 16:14.030
The Mahiru Shiina who acts like 
an angel is adored, and she's wanted.

16:15.330 --> 16:18.280
But the real me isn't wanted at all.

16:18.930 --> 16:23.800
I know that's the face I present to the world,
 so it's dumb to feel bitter about it.

16:26.450 --> 16:31.190
I know I'm really not very nice. 
I'm cowardly and selfish.

16:31.730 --> 16:34.380
I'm inherently mean-spirited 
and I have a sharp tongue.

16:34.380 --> 16:36.800
Nothing about me is likable.

16:36.800 --> 16:38.470
I actually like you a lot.

16:40.470 --> 16:44.460
Sure, sometimes you aren't very nice,

16:44.460 --> 16:48.560
but you're still someone 
I care about and want to protect.

16:48.560 --> 16:50.230
That's how I feel.

16:52.390 --> 16:55.780
I like the way you don't mince words.

16:56.140 --> 17:00.370
And if you were really mean-spirited, 
you wouldn't be worried about this stuff.

17:00.830 --> 17:02.540
Stop second-guessing yourself.

17:05.210 --> 17:06.940
Give yourself some credit.

17:07.440 --> 17:11.050
You have someone right here 
who sees and likes the real you.

17:16.300 --> 17:21.470
Hmm? Ah! No... 
I mean, Chitose thinks so, too!

17:21.850 --> 17:25.720
I didn't mean anything by that! 
It isn't just me!

17:25.720 --> 17:28.270
My parents, Chitose and Itsuki...

17:28.270 --> 17:31.820
They see your un-angelic parts 
and still really like you!

17:31.820 --> 17:35.340
You don't realize it, but you're... yeah...

17:36.720 --> 17:38.660
a much more likable person than you think!

17:40.730 --> 17:42.630
Why are you crying again?!

17:43.560 --> 17:45.550
I just feel really blessed.

17:45.550 --> 17:47.880
I don't think you're nearly blessed enough.

17:48.390 --> 17:50.880
It's okay to put yourself first sometimes.

17:51.720 --> 17:53.880
Then can I ask you a favor?

17:54.200 --> 17:55.210
What is it?

17:55.610 --> 17:58.130
It's something only you can do, Amane-kun.

17:59.860 --> 18:01.720
Please look at me more.

18:02.820 --> 18:05.450
I already see how hard you work,

18:05.450 --> 18:08.090
and if I look away, 
I feel like you might fly off somewhere.

18:08.090 --> 18:09.150
I'm watching.

18:09.760 --> 18:11.650
And please hold on to me.

18:12.360 --> 18:14.020
I'll hold on to your hand.

18:16.360 --> 18:18.030
Just for today,

18:21.240 --> 18:23.940
please hold on to all of me.

18:34.610 --> 18:35.910
Is something wrong?

18:36.330 --> 18:41.820
I-It's just... I'm embarrassed that you 
saw me acting so pathetic earlier.

18:41.820 --> 18:43.520
It really doesn't bother me.

18:43.520 --> 18:45.270
But it bothers <i>me</i>!

18:45.680 --> 18:48.680
You need to let yourself 
depend on others more.

18:48.680 --> 18:50.900
You know, you aren't alone.

18:52.900 --> 18:54.480
I'm not alone?

18:54.860 --> 18:56.670
I'm right here next to you.

18:56.670 --> 18:59.280
Then there's Itsuki, Chitose, 
my mom and dad...

19:00.230 --> 19:03.660
A lot of people think you're special 
because you're you, Mahiru.

19:05.760 --> 19:07.220
Do you, too?

19:08.040 --> 19:12.110
Do you think I'm special, too, Amane-kun?

19:12.110 --> 19:15.420
Yeah, well... we spend so much time together,

19:15.420 --> 19:18.050
of course I'm gonna think you're special.

19:19.200 --> 19:21.510
Is that... right?

19:23.510 --> 19:27.260
Amane-kun, do you want to go out for a bit?

19:33.090 --> 19:34.770
The new term starts soon.

19:35.150 --> 19:38.780
Yeah, I know. The thought of changing 
classes is depressing, though.

19:39.320 --> 19:42.030
I'm looking forward to changing classes.

19:42.670 --> 19:46.030
Because you might be 
in the same class as Chitose?

20:01.480 --> 20:03.060
M-Mahiru?

20:05.270 --> 20:08.310
I just wanted... to thank you again.

20:08.890 --> 20:10.860
O-Oh.

20:12.360 --> 20:16.120
You've done so, so much for me, Amane-kun.

20:16.860 --> 20:18.940
I haven't done anything special.

20:18.940 --> 20:20.900
It's all been special to me.

20:21.800 --> 20:25.260
Having you beside me makes me so happy.

20:25.640 --> 20:28.570
I don't think I could have handled it alone.

20:30.900 --> 20:32.040
Okay.

20:32.590 --> 20:35.520
Please keep looking at me, like you promised.

20:35.520 --> 20:37.360
And don't let your eyes wander!

20:37.360 --> 20:39.020
O-Okay?

20:39.020 --> 20:41.020
I can't see you right now, though.

20:41.520 --> 20:43.340
If you look now, I'll get mad.

20:44.440 --> 20:46.550
You're so unreasonable.

20:47.730 --> 20:51.560
<i>At this rate, it'd be weird 
if I </i>didn't<i> fall for her.</i>

20:55.440 --> 20:56.900
Oh, wow.

21:01.730 --> 21:07.740
I never really liked cherry blossoms. 
Or even spring.

21:07.740 --> 21:08.650
Huh?

21:09.450 --> 21:12.910
At school entrance ceremonies... 
graduation ceremonies, too,

21:12.910 --> 21:15.000
I was always alone.

21:15.710 --> 21:18.230
I didn't have anyone to hold my hand.

21:18.830 --> 21:20.750
Nobody to walk with me.

21:22.240 --> 21:25.460
So I never really liked spring.

21:25.900 --> 21:29.010
It reminded me of the pain of being alone.

21:30.130 --> 21:31.970
I'm here with you right now.

21:32.730 --> 21:33.680
Yes, you are.

21:34.220 --> 21:37.100
I hope I can be enough for you today.

21:37.660 --> 21:38.940
You aren't "enough."

21:40.270 --> 21:40.980
Sorry, then.

21:40.980 --> 21:43.680
No, that isn't what I meant!

21:44.640 --> 21:47.990
It's not like I'm <i>settling</i> for you. Okay?

21:48.300 --> 21:50.740
Oh, y-yeah?

21:54.150 --> 21:56.250
I'm glad I came here with you, Amane-kun.

21:59.240 --> 22:03.420
I think I like cherry blossoms 
a little more now.

22:15.580 --> 22:18.090
<i>Hey, darling, something I gotta say—</i>

22:18.090 --> 22:20.830
<i>will you listen and not laugh it away?</i>

22:20.830 --> 22:23.530
<i>I think if I just said, "I love you,"</i>

22:23.530 --> 22:25.680
<i>it would sound really lame</i>

22:25.680 --> 22:31.440
<i>But you know, any other words I try 
wouldn't tell you what's really on my mind</i>

22:31.440 --> 22:36.300
<i>See? I knew you would start laughing 
and teasing me anyway</i>

22:36.300 --> 22:41.580
<i>Did you make the right choice 
to spend your life with me?</i>

22:41.580 --> 22:49.960
<i>Do you really think it's okay? I don't know</i>

22:49.960 --> 22:55.150
<i>But through the tears and the laughter, 
the days you spend with me</i>

22:55.150 --> 23:05.660
<i>Being able to stand next to each other 
has become the reason I'm living today</i>

23:05.660 --> 23:11.260
<i>So I dedicate to you this song of our love</i>

23:11.260 --> 23:15.950
<i>After all of the nights 
we've seen through to the day</i>

23:15.950 --> 23:25.070
<i>I'm with you, together, 
singing about our love</i>

23:34.890 --> 23:39.890
Next Time
